    "input": "search_query: Hi Northwind Outdoor Support,\n\nI\u2019m writing to report an issue with my recent return. As a small business owner, I rely on your gear for client events, so I was surprised to find a $12.50 charge for the prepaid return label on my invoice. I understand this is a flat fee, but it feels steep for a single item, especially when I\u2019m trying to manage tight margins. \n\nMore concerning, I was also charged a 15% restocking fee. I want to clarify that the tent I returned was in perfect, unused condition. It was still in its original packaging with all tags attached, exactly as it arrived. I never opened it or used it, so applying a restocking fee seems incorrect based on your policy regarding items not in perfect condition. \n\nCould you please review my account and remove the restocking fee? I\u2019d also appreciate an explanation for the label cost, as I wasn\u2019t aware of this specific charge before initiating the return. I value your service and hope we can resolve this quickly so I can continue ordering for my business. \n\nThanks,\nSarah",
